@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: User Clicks File

actor User
participant Frontend
participant "API (FastAPI)" as API
database "ContextDB" as DB

User -> Frontend: Clicks on "MyReport.pdf"
activate Frontend

Frontend -> API: GET /api/context/path/to/MyReport.pdf
activate API

API -> DB: SELECT * FROM documents WHERE filepath=...
activate DB

DB --> API: Returns document context (summary, tags, etc.)
deactivate DB

API --> Frontend: 200 OK with JSON data
deactivate API

Frontend -> Frontend: Renders context in preview pane
deactivate Frontend

@enduml
